---
/**
 * Page wallpaper: a k-nearest-neighbour graph over simulated cell positions —
 * the same construction the spatial-omics models on this site are built on,
 * rather than generic circuitry.
 *
 * Geometry is generated once and inlined, so there is no runtime JavaScript and
 * no layout cost. Colour comes from `currentColor`, so it follows the accent in
 * both themes; the caller masks and fades it.
 */
---

